Time-aware NVARC for ARC-AGI-2
ARC Prize 2026 entry by Oscar Ariza (Kaggle: oscarariza3).

This product includes software derived from NVARC
(https://github.com/1ytic/NVARC), the ARC Prize 2025 winning solution by
Ivan Sorokin et al., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
pipeline/arc_loader.py, pipeline/arc_decoder.py, pipeline/unsloth_qwen3_flash.patch,
and the test-time training and decoding code in pipeline/llm_worker.py and
pipeline/starter.py.

The GPU-side log-probability computation in pipeline/llm_worker.py is adapted
from mikelou1's public Kaggle notebook "ARC AGI2 LB33.89 Minimal Perfpatch",
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications: time-aware test-time training, dynamic per-task budget and
ordering, decode guarantee, crash isolation, background rule solver
(arc_solver.py), second-pass extensions and commit-run diagnostics.
